abstract: >
  A simulation-focused research framework implementing numerical solvers,
  MCMC-based parameter inference, and mathematical consistency checks for
  the Dark Vital Dimensional Hypothesis (DVDH), designed for local-scale
  astrophysical anomaly investigation.
